## Gotcha: "No area" after an add-on restart

The editor loads entities and areas once, together, in `store.ts`. `HomeAssistantCatalogService` swallows registry failures (`runCatching`), so a load during or just after an add-on restart can return every entity under "No area". A page refresh fixes it. This is not a code bug, so don't chase it after a deploy.

